@startuml flowfield-volume
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam BoxPadding 6
hide footbox
title Volume3D - cooperative build and safe publication

participant "Manager" as M
participant "BuildDriver\n/ Scheduler" as Q
participant "VolumeSession" as S
participant "ObstacleTracker\n/ ModifierRegistry" as O
participant "Build steps\n/ BuildContext" as B
participant "SafetyState\n/ FieldData" as P

M -> S : Submit / coalesce latest request
M -> S : LateUpdate: observe live changes
S -> O : Observe Collider and Modifier metadata
note over Q,S : BuildDriver.LateUpdate supplies a shared 2ms CPU budget.\nSuspended / faulted work does not consume repeated turns.
loop Runnable work at the scheduler boundary
  Q -> S : PumpInternal(budget)
  S -> O : Observe registered inputs
  opt Starting a pending build
    S -> O : Capture fixed Modifier snapshots
    S -> B : Create context with accepted request\nand per-build arrays / cursors
  end
  alt RuntimeDynamic
    S -> B : Advance obstacle, topology and Goal phases
    S -> B : Advance BFS, directions and escape phases
    note over S,B : Navigation helpers / Solver / GPU validator participate.\nGPU completion records a result; later Pump steps validate it.\nManaged fallback uses the same captured navigation input.
  else StaticBaked
    S -> B : Copy validated v6 base data in chunks
  end
  S -> B : Advance Modifier composition phase
  opt Build complete and owner still current
    S -> P : Commit complete field and clear observed safety regions
    S --> M : FieldChanged
  end
end
note over S,O : External getters / CaptureSnapshot / Modify check lifetime and ownership.\nCancelled work stops; it cannot overwrite a newer request or publication.
M -> S : Provider.TrySample(position)
S -> P : Read committed field + latest safety limits
S --> M : Sample; unsafe / unknown cells can be stopped with true
@enduml
